From: Oleksandr Grytsov <oleksandr_grytsov@epam.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Oct 2017 17:23:23 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] docs: add vgsx xl.cfg entry

Signed-off-by: Oleksandr Grytsov <oleksandr_grytsov@epam.com>
Reviewed-by: Oleksandr Andrushchenko <oleksandr_andrushchenko@epam.com>
Reviewed-by: Andrii Anisov <andrii_anisov@epam.com>
(cherry picked from commit 8d4926a3ed7e2c55ceb5e3f53f9bb102784814b9)
---
 docs/man/xl.cfg.5.pod.in | 23 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 23 insertions(+)

diff --git a/docs/man/xl.cfg.5.pod.in b/docs/man/xl.cfg.5.pod.in
index d34951edb9..24f2c94705 100644
--- a/docs/man/xl.cfg.5.pod.in
+++ b/docs/man/xl.cfg.5.pod.in
@@ -1754,6 +1754,29 @@ This feature is a B<technology preview>.
 
 =back
 
+=over 4
+
+=item B<vgsx=[ "VGSX_SPEC_STRING", "VGSX_SPEC_STRING", ...]>
+
+Specifies the virtual GSX device to be provided to the guest.
+
+Each B<VGSX_SPEC_STRING> is a comma-separated list of C<KEY=VALUE>
+settings from the following list:
+
+=over 4
+
+=item B<backend=domain-id>
+
+Specifies the backend domain name or id.
+
+=item B<osid=NUMBER>
+
+Specifies OS ID.
+
+=back
+
+=back
+
 =head2 Paravirtualised (PV) Guest Specific Options
 
 The following options apply only to Paravirtual (PV) guests.
